<p><a name="fn3"></a>3. See <a href="https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2023-09-18/pdf/2023-19200.pdf">Regulatory Capital Rule: Large Banking Organizations and Banking Organizations with Significant Trading Activity (PDF)</a>, 88 Fed. Reg. 64,028, at 64,168 (proposed September 18, 2023). <a href="#f3">Return to text</a></p>

<p><a name="fn4"></a>4. Economic Growth, Regulatory Relief, and Consumer Protection Act, Pub. L. No. 115-174, 132 Stat. 1296 (2018). <a href="#f4">Return to text</a></p>

