<p><a name="fn6"></a>6. While the climate guidance was released shortly after the U.S. Department of the Treasury's pronouncements about net-zero financing and investment, the climate guidance is silent about "net-zero" commitments. <em>See </em><a href="https://home.treasury.gov/system/files/136/NetZeroPrinciples.pdf">U.S. Department of the Treasury, Principles for Net-Zero Financing &amp; Investment (PDF)</a> (Washington: U.S. Treasury Department, September 2023). <a href="#f6">Return to text</a></p>
                     
